---
alwaysApply: true
---

Skills are sourced from `https://github.com/K-Dense-AI/scientific-agent-skills`
at the revision pinned in `skills.lock.json`. The `docx`, `pdf`, `pptx`, and
`xlsx` office skills are pinned per skill to `https://github.com/anthropics/skills`
(Apache-2.0); K-Dense changes to them go in `skill-overrides/<skill>/` and are
declared under `overrides` in `skills.lock.json`.

Never edit `skills/`, `.claude/skills/`, or
`scientific_writer/.claude/skills/` directly. Make skill-content changes in
the upstream repository, then run:

```bash
python3 scripts/sync_skills.py --update-ref <tag-or-commit>
```
